@page "/components/command"

<PageTitle>Command — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Command</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    A command palette without cmdk. Every item is already in the DOM as a link, and the compiler
    hides the ones that do not match — so the palette is a filtered list with JavaScript and a
    plain list of links without it.
</p>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Inline</h2>
